with well-differentiated nonmedullary thyroid cancer: a review</article-title><source>Thyroid</source><year>2002</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>683</fpage><lpage>702</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12225637</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1089/105072502760258668</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Niedziela</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pathogenesis, diagnosis and management of thyroid nodules in children</article-title><source>Endocr Relat Cancer</source><year>2006</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>427</fpage><lpage>453</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16728572</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1677/erc.1.00882</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hosler</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name><name><surname>Clark</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Zakowski</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name><name><surname>Westra</surname><given-names>WH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ali</surname><given-names>SZ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cytopathologic analysis of thyroid lesions in the pediatric population</article-title><source>Diagn Cytopathol</source><year>2006</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>101</fpage><lpage>105</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16514673</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/dc.20388</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lyshchik</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Drozd</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Demidchik</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Reiners</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Diagnosis of thyroid cancer in children: value of gray-scale and power doppler US</article-title><source>Radiology</source><year>2005</year><volume>235</volume><fpage>604</fpage><lpage>613</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15770036</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1148/radiol.2352031942</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Taki</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Terahata</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamashita</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinuya</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Nobata</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kakuda</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kodama</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamamoto</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Thyroid calcifications: sonographic patterns and incidence of cancer</article-title><source>Clin Imaging</source><year>2004</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>368</fpage><lpage>371</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15471671</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0899-7071(03)00190-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Braverman LE</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Management of Thyroid Cancer</article-title><source>Diseases of the Thyroid</source><year>2003</year><volume>13</volume><edition>2nd</edition><publisher-name>Totowa, NJ, Humana Press, Inc.</publisher-name><fpage>263</fpage><lpage>290</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>